WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.740
Meet the Copper Crown.

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:08.600
A stainless steel kettle sits inside an ornamental jacket,
above a protected electric heater.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.620
A domed lid catches splashes.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:18.300
The riser carries vapor onward, while a separate
open vent gives it another escape.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.690
Vapor enters a descending steel coil inside a second vessel.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:27.500
Cool water surrounds the coil but never touches the product.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:34.700
A free-draining spout delivers the condensate
into a separate, open glass carafe.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.450
Heat turns water into vapor.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:42.450
The coil gives that heat to the cooling water,
and vapor returns to liquid.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:47.500
Keep the vent and outlet open, and stop if cooling fails.
